      "body": "## Motivation\n\nStateful speculative drafts need a separate HiCache pool identifier for convolution/recurrent state, distinct from the target's `mamba` pool and draft KV pools.\n\n## Modifications\n\nRegister `draft_mamba` in Python's `PoolName`, the Rust enum, and Rust's string conversion/parser: four added lines. This only enables pool registration; draft-state lifecycle and storage-backend support are separate work.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nReused the existing CPU test `test_every_pool_name_crosses_the_prefetch_commit_boundary`, which exercises every Python pool name through the compiled Rust interface. Adding only the Python enum reproduces `ValueError: unknown pool name: draft_mamba`; the complete change passes.\n\nFour CPU tests passed, including HiCache backup/restore and Mamba/SWA prefetch commits:\n\n```bash\nPYTHONPATH=python CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' python -m pytest -q \\\n  test/registered/unit/mem_cache/test_rust_tree_core_integration.py \\\n  -k 'every_pool_name or hicache_write_through or mamba_prefetch_commit or swa_prefetch_commit'\n```\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #41650838529](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41650838529)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41650838516](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41650838516)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #41650838295](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41650838295)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Base CI only covers the core cases, and its workload may not exercise your change. Use `/rerun-test` to run the tests your change touches, or copy this prompt for an agent:\n>\n> ```text\n> Find the registered tests this PR affects and run them with /rerun-test, following https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.agents/skills/rerun-test/SKILL.md\n> ```\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
